[04:25.50]Nur dich.
[04:27.24]
[04:27.64]Wenn ich mich je verliebe,
[04:30.80]dann sicherlich...
[04:33.73]
[04:34.13]Alfred:
[04:34.90]
[04:35.24]... in eine Frau wie dich.
[04:36.72]
[04:37.12]Sarah:
[04:37.49]
[04:37.92]... in einen so wie dich.
[04:38.37]
[04:38.97]Ensemble:
